WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:50.350
Someone once said...

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:54.290
There's a plant made of crispy tempura...

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:58.030
Templantura!

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:02.600
There are juicy pineapples 
that grow on hyenas...

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:06.870
Hyenapples!

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.800
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:15.510
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:21.480
Gratitude is What Counts! The 
Secret to Honoring the Food!

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.890
Toriko-san, you're a glutton...

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.690
This meat is delicious...

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:32.930
Gimme another helping...

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:39.000
What the...?!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.770
Good morning.

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:44.070
Good morning!

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:46.010
Um, what was that just now...?

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.440
A gong announcing that it is time to rise.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:51.080
But it's still dark outside...

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:54.510
Yes. Morning comes early at Chowlin Temple.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:58.680
Put this on and come to the dojo, please.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:10.300
I kind of feel inspired, you know?

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.460
It's like they say, clothes make the man.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.200
Alright. From today, your 
true training will begin.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.970
It's a special menu of constant guidance.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:21.310
Special menu?

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.810
Yes. Master Chin's instructions.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.410
I'm lookin' forward to it.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:29.610
I'm gonna quickly master Honoring the 
Food and then capture the Bubble Fruit!

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.950
We're in your capable hands, 
Assistant Instructor.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.650
Then let's begin the training right away.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.890
We'll start with Food Meditation.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:38.620
Food Meditation?

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.490
Every day at Chowlin Temple

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:45.430
begins not with Zen meditation 
but Food Meditation.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:47.330
Food Meditation

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:47.100
Food Meditation is an exercise

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.070
that mentally prepares you 
to be grateful to food.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.800
You begin by calming your mind

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.970
then turn your ears towards 
the pulse of your own life.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:59.540
You're talkin' about losing 
yourself in a trance state, huh?

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:00.610
No.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.110
No?!

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:07.020
Losing the self... Unselfishness... Another 
way to put it is desiring nothing.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.120
A state of wanting nothing.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.990
According to Honoring the Food, 
that belongs to worldly thoughts.

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:17.390
Anyway, the foundation of Honoring the Food

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.860
is the expression of gratitude.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:24.000
You dispel all worldly thoughts and 
show your gratitude for everything.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.300
Gratitude, huh?

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:30.140
Do you know what is in front of you?

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.170
No, what is it?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:35.680
A horsetail that burns like a 
horse... A Torch Horsetail, right?

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:38.250
Not just any Torch Horsetail.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:42.790
If it detects any worldly thoughts other 
than gratitude, the flame goes out.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:46.920
Master Chin made the alteration 
for the betterment of training.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:53.530
Now focus solely on gratitude to keep 
the flame from being extinguished.

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:55.560
Gratitude...

00:04:56.260 --> 00:05:00.840
For a start, do your best to 
maintain the flame for 30 minutes.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:04.240
After you're done with 
that, we'll have breakfast.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.470
Breakfast...

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:11.110
Toriko-san, your worldly 
thoughts were wide open!

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:15.220
And how powerful were those worldly 
thoughts, to blow out my flame too?!

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:15.850
Sorry!

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.520
That was fast.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:21.060
The torch will relight itself 
if you again focus on gratitude.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.160
Try not to make it go out this time.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:33.230
We finally made the flames 
last a total of 30 minutes...

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:36.840
Though we weren't able to keep it going 
for more than five minutes at a time...

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.710
F-Feeling gratitude towards food

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:42.680
is more difficult than I 
thought. It takes patience...

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.310
Alright, let's have breakfast.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:46.850
Yes!

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:50.220
Rice

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.650
Rice is in that jar.

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.650
Put as much as you like in the bowl.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:54.120
Then we'll boil it.

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:57.660
Great! But those bowls 
might not be big enough!

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.760
However, the utensils 
you'll use to take them...

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.930
...are the chopsticks on this tray.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:08.530
It's called EIR, Egg In Rice.

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:11.470
Tiny eggs are inside of each grain of rice.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.670
If you cook them, you'll get 
piping hot boiled egg rice.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.640
It looks delicious!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:20.010
But before boiling, they're 
as fragile as raw eggs,

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.720
so you'll need to pick them up gently 
with the chopsticks, a grain at a time.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:28.290
As if eating beans with 5-foot-long 
chopsticks wasn't bad enough yesterday...

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.320
Why do these meals have 
to be so frustrating?!

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.320
I'm sure this is part of our training, too.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.100
Crap! It broke!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.500
They're all breaking!

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.370
If the broken insides spill out,

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:48.770
it becomes a regular grain of rice.

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:54.710
Incidentally, when one breaks, the grains 
around it also break, so be careful.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:56.510
Why didn't you tell us that before?!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.580
They're disappearing in a chain reaction!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.680
Our breakfast!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.620
For crying out loud... It's 
too early for this noise...

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.290
Alright...

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.730
Now that you've fortified 
yourselves with a meal,

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:12.530
let's move on to the next exercise.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:16.230
Who's fortified? I hardly had anything...

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.640
Why are there so many holes?

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.140
Komatsu-san...

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:25.940
Yes?

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:29.050
The basic stance of Honoring the Food...

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:31.010
Do you know what it is?

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.920
You mean putting your 
hands together and bowing?

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.950
Yes. That's correct.

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:40.520
In this exercise, you're going 
to learn the proper form

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.120
of putting your hands together and bowing.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:45.230
We're always putting our 
hands together and bowing!

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:46.800
Right, Toriko-san?

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:50.270
Well, yeah. All my meals start with that.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:55.070
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:00.480
What the...?! Cactus?!

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.240
Gratitude Cactus.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:07.850
I advise you to maintain 
proper form at all times.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.120
Otherwise, you could be seriously injured.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.330
Quickly, hands together and bow!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.660
Thank you for the food!

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.930
Why?! Our hands are 
together and we're bowing!

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:25.170
I told you. If the form isn't proper...

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.140
I don't know about "seriously 
injured", but it hurts like hell...

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:39.350
No, I can tell that it has the 
power of life and death over me...

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:44.750
Okay, we'll finish today's 
training with a meal.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:46.590
We're done already?!

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:47.390
Yes.

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:48.420
What's that?!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.490
Rose Ham seeds.

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:53.990
These seeds bloom into a ham 
flower that looks like a rose.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:55.730
A ham flower?

00:08:55.730 --> 00:09:01.170
Yes. Please watch over these seeds until 
they germinate and the flowers bloom.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.100
Without any sleep or breaks...

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:10.040
Watch over them... without 
any sleep or breaks...

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.610
And don't forget to focus on gratitude.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.460
What is this?

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.830
When the hell is it gonna bud?

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.940
Gourmet Dojo

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:45.640
Yes!

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.210
Buds finally came out!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.480
Congratulations.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:52.250
Still, it took one night to bud...

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:57.820
Incidentally, with Rose Ham, the 
stronger the feeling of gratitude,

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.590
the faster it blooms.

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:01.990
Oh, really?

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.960
Do your best and don't stop appreciating.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.130
Otherwise...

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.230
...you'll never eat again.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.010
Yeah!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.510
They bloomed!

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:25.920
So you can finally eat.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.720
It looks just like a ham sandwich!

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:34.590
Yes. It's a Sandwich Butterfly.

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:36.890
The ham flower!

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:40.500
Yes. That butterfly loves the ham petals.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:45.800
Assistant Instructor! You gotta tell 
us these important things before!

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:50.110
Go away! This is my dinner! 
Or is that breakfast?

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:51.870
Maybe my lunch!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:54.040
What's with this simple training?

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.550
Are we really gonna master 
Honoring the Food this way?!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.800
Bubble Fruit...

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:21.770
Still no good, huh?

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.570
Even though they're right in front of me...

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.840
With training like that,

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:29.810
I doubt I'll be able to capture Bubble Fruit.

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.950
I thought I'd find you here!

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.110
Komatsu...

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.880
Are you worried about the training?

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.150
What do you think about it?

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.560
Actually... I'm having fun.

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:48.500
Certainly, we're doing simple 
tasks and I do think it's tough,

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.160
but it's fun.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:55.670
I'm learning at the same pace as you, 
Toriko-san, and we're growing together.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:57.710
When I think of it like 
that, it makes me happy.

00:11:58.770 --> 00:12:01.910
Well, if we grow from this, fine, but...

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:03.480
I...

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.780
When you lost to the assistant instructor...

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:13.220
How can I put it?

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.560
I was so frustrated...

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.630
It's pathetic,

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:23.360
but I thought I was going to cry...

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.900
It was the first time I ever felt like that.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:31.340
So with the Enamel Cabbage shredding 
contest against the assistant instructor,

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:35.210
I seriously felt that I 
wanted to avenge you...

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:39.680
Although I got creamed...

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:40.750
Komatsu...

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:43.280
Toriko-san, let's learn 
Honoring the Food together

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:46.290
and beat the assistant 
instructor for sure next time!

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:49.960
Then we'll capture the Bubble Fruit!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.720
Yeah. You're right.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.900
Thanks, Komatsu.

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:01.900
We're definitely gonna get that Bubble Fruit!

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:15.180
30 minutes without the flames going out...

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:16.710
You did it.

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:19.180
We finally did it!

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:25.190
Normally it takes a month to maintain a 
Torch Horsetail flame for 30 minutes...

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:28.330
But they did it in three days. Wonderful...

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:32.300
I didn't realize being continuously 
grateful would be so exhausting...

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.500
It does take a lot of stamina, doesn't it?

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:38.440
Eventually, you'll be 
able to do it naturally.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:42.970
Well, starting tomorrow, we'll extend 
the Food Meditation period to one hour.

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.910
After that, we'll increase the 
number of Torch Horsetails.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.680
That reminds me, the more 
Torch Horsetails there are,

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.450
the easier it is for them to 
detect any worldly thoughts.

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:01.560
Breakfast is White Fish Noodles.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:05.060
Thank you for the food.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:10.430
Huh?

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:14.200
White Fish Noodles are slippery, 
so they're hard to pick up.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:17.070
On top of that, these chopsticks 
are made of slippery Ice Wood,

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:21.880
so an even higher degree of concentration 
is required to catch them.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.080
I can't pick them up at all!

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.780
This is so annoying!

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:35.860
It looks like you've both mastered the 
basic hands together and bowing stance.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.430
So now...

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.730
Pudding from the hump of a Pudding Camel...

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:46.900
Maintain the Honoring the Food stance 
while balancing the pudding on your head.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.340
This pudding is extremely soft,

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:52.110
so moving even a few millimeters 
will make it break down.

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:54.780
Please concentrate.

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.060
Toriko-san...

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.560
Today's lunch...

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.740
...will be eaten with 
ten-meter long chopsticks.

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:38.350
Toriko-san, please stay calm!

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:44.890
At that level of gratitude, the ham 
flower won't blossom anytime soon.

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:50.930
It looks like you'll be going 
without dinner tonight, too.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.370
All of a sudden!

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:02.840
S-Sandwich Butterfly!

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:05.240
Perfect timing.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:07.950
You can show your gratitude 
to the Sandwich Butterfly.

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:12.780
Why do I gotta be grateful to some 
bug that wants to eat my flower?!

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:17.960
If it knows you're grateful to it, 
surely it won't do anything like that.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:24.830
Anyway, send it away with gratitude. 
This, too, is training.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.310
When I could get it outta here 
with a simple wave of my hand...

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.380
What the hell kinda training is this?!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:47.080
All of these mundane tasks and I don't 
see what the point of any of them are!

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:51.360
Will we really be able to master 
Honoring the Food by doin' this stuff?!

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:54.960
Toriko-san!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.140
What was that?!

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:10.110
By cultivating gratitude towards food,

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:13.640
your power of concentration towards 
a physical object is increasing.

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:21.080
Improvement in concentration produces 
faster movements and precision.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.120
In other words, needless 
movements are pruned away

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:28.420
and you're able to do a move with the 
minimum amount of power and form.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:32.390
True, I just meant to shoo 
away that butterfly...

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.560
But that force...

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:37.430
If you had released it with 
thoughts of gratitude as well,

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:39.400
I'm sure it would have 
been even more powerful.

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:44.370
Proper form is better than brute force.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:47.880
If you make an efficient move while 
embracing thoughts of gratitude,

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:50.080
your energy will be delivered 
more effectively.

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:56.080
Toriko-san, that's the 
true power of your skills.

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:58.120
This is... Honoring the Food?!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.990
This is still just the gateway 
to Honoring the Food.

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:05.360
Eventually, you'll be able to produce 
skills with even more explosive power

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:08.500
just by blinking an eye or breathing.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:10.770
Seriously?!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:14.440
But to do that, you require more training.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.470
Right now, you're not even 
able to shoo away butterflies.

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:22.580
And next time, please try to do 
it with thoughts of gratitude.

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:27.380
Yeah! The training is dull, but 
the results are tremendous!

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:30.650
Yeah! It's incredible!

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:32.650
Komatsu-san, you too...

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:35.490
A Puffer Whale?!

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:37.660
Knocking has been applied to it.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:39.560
You've handled these before, haven't you?

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:40.860
Y-Yes...

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.200
I have experience with it,

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.470
Puffer Whales are a Special 
Preparation Ingredient

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.500
and the position of their poison 
sac varies from whale to whale.

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:52.110
The method of preparation differs 
with each individual whale...

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:54.710
Komatsu-san, please try to prepare it.

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:55.940
But...

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:56.940
Just do it.

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:58.580
Alright...

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:07.750
What is this sensation?

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:11.890
Komatsu, you...

00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:14.190
I know... I know what to do!

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:16.960
I instinctively know the 
order of preparation...

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:20.370
You prepared a Puffer Whale in an instant!

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:23.970
I don't believe it... I'm stunned myself...

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:26.970
Through training, your concentration 
towards food has increased,

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.240
and that combined with your 
cooking experience and knowledge,

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:32.410
has made you able to intuitively sense

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:36.550
the best way to prepare 
it so that it's delicious.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:39.780
Intuitively?

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:42.720
Wait a second! Look!

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:47.260
It isn't yellow! Even though 
I removed its poison sac!

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:54.430
It hasn't yet noticed that you cut 
it open and removed its poison sac.

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:59.470
It's because your knife handling 
was so speedy and delicate.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:04.440
This is your true technique, Komatsu-san, 
devoid of unnecessary movement.

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:06.540
M-M-My...?

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.210
When it comes to masters 
of Honoring the Food,

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:13.880
some can take out the poison sac of a 
swimming Puffer Whale without Knocking.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:17.890
And I know of one master who 
prepared a giant fish so well

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.860
that it didn't realize it'd been gutted

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.130
and swam around for years.

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.960
It's on record.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.230
W-Will I...

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:28.160
Will I be able to do that someday?

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.600
Yes. I'm sure you'll be able to.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.200
Alright, Komatsu!

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:35.170
Let's keep training and 
master Honoring the Food!

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.340
Right, Toriko-san!

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:41.980
One could say that their 
training is going smoothly...

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:47.650
This is probably my last 
job in the Human World.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:51.750
I'd better fill my stomach...

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:11.640
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:19.510
The world is spinning

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.790
A dream flower

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:28.420
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:35.530
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:39.600
Lead me by the hand

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:42.900
And take me with you

00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:50.080
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.980
Red shoes

00:21:54.310 --> 00:21:57.580
I can't take off

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:09.000
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.830
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:18.370
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:25.410
Hiding Level
12

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:21.270
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 12!

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:23.240
The allotted time limit is 15 seconds!

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:25.110
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:28.380
It seems this is the Regal 
Highlands in Biotope 1,

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:31.980
but with a heaping helping 
of Beasts here, it's hard!

00:22:31.980 --> 00:22:35.690
Here's a hint! Yun is hiding 
in a pretty bold place.

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:39.460
Yun is... right here!

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:49.330
You say, "That's not hiding!"?

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:50.300
I put my hands together

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:52.040
and bow!

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:54.010
I apologize.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:59.340
But this segment will be back with 
a heaping helping of fun next time,

00:22:59.340 --> 00:23:00.310
so keep watching!

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:04.880
Whoa! Next time, there's a surprising 
development in store for Toriko, too!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:10.190
Oh no, here it comes! Something dangerous is headed towards the Chowlin Temple!

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:13.180
What is that?! It's the end of the world!

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:17.130
Approaching Threat! Hurry, Toriko! The Path to the Bubble Fruit!

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:19.310
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
